# Pitch outline (5 minutes)

1. Problem: skilled tradespeople have nothing a stranger can verify
2. Numbers: 80-90% informal workforce, 4.1% formally trained, 30.6% trained informally
3. Solution: video of a real task -> AI rubric pre-score -> human vouch -> shareable passport
4. Demo: pick task, upload video, rubric result, passport with QR
5. Architecture: React PWA, FastAPI on AWS, Gemini, ElevenLabs, Supabase and S3
6. What is new: judge the work, not the classroom; AI plus human, neither alone
7. Risks: AI misjudges (pre-score only), fake vouches (OTP, rate limits)
8. Business model: free for workers, paid by the people who hire
